message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the article."
title: "Analysis code for: Evaluating AI-Generated Facial Expressions as Affective Interface Cues"
abstract: >-
  R code reproducing the questionnaire, fNIRS, eye-tracking and exploratory
  Bayesian analyses of a multimodal comparison between selected AI-generated and
  human facial-expression stimuli across seven intended emotion categories.
